        "official_en_sha256": "74252749f90d8d4fe6b5372091a9d8730bef6945ae777754ddf6bc019f1f953c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なんか、オルデリオンも大変らしいからな、\r\n持ちつ持たれつって言うし、\r\nちょっと手伝いにでも行こうかね。",
        "official_en": "I heard Olderion has it rough now, too, so I’m thinking of going to lend a hand. One good turn deserves another, as they say.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
