        "official_en_sha256": "2c9f5d5cc96aceca84fd5e9cecb01169ac323acca2b75eedb9e448d73096dca7"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ふふふ、いつか紹介してくれるのを\r\n楽しみに待つとするかねえ。",
        "official_en": "Hehe! All I can do is wait until they’re ready to introduce me to their friend.",
        "real_en": "Hehe. I suppose I'll look forward to the day they introduce me."
      },
      "review": {
