      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "スコットさん、飛空艇団の再建のために\r\n毎日遅くまで頑張ってて……\r\n無理やり休んでもらってるくらいなんです。",
        "official_en": "Scott is working so ardently to rebuild the airship squadron that it is difficult to convince him to rest.",
        "real_en": "Scott-san has been working late every day to rebuild the airship squadron... We practically have to force him to take a break."
      },
