      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レインさんが参加してくだされば、\r\n盛り上がること間違いありません。\r\nぜひ、腕試ししていってください！",
        "official_en": "The crowd is sure to go wild if you were to take part in the battles there. Please give it a try if the mood strikes you!",
        "real_en": "If Rain-san takes part, the crowd's sure to get excited. Please, give it a try and show us your skills!"
